Package: tinycensus
Title: Lightweight Interface to the US Census Bureau API
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Christopher T.",
           family = "Kenny",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "ctkenny@proton.me",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-9386-6860"))
Description: Download data from the United States Census Bureau API
    <https://www.census.gov/data/developers/data-sets.html>. The package
    uses Census metadata endpoints to discover datasets, variables, groups,
    and supported geographies, then returns lightweight tidy results.
    Optional spatial output is joined through 'tinytiger'.
